    "bytes": 16777216,
    "sha256": "bffccac33cc78ceb201a9c7d204aeba1964ef3c566828ee7ac4ff43e9d29bbd8",
    "recipe": [
      "Create a 16 MiB partitionless HFS+ image with hdiutil create -size 16m -fs HFS+ -layout NONE and label Pomologie Attribute Overflow.",
      "Mount the disposable image read-write. Write sample, then use the Darwin setxattr API to set org.pomologie.inline to short and org.pomologie.contiguous to 4097 ASCII zero bytes.",
      "Write and fsync 192 single-block ballast files. Fill almost all remaining free blocks with a tail ballast file. Delete alternating ballast files to leave dispersed free blocks.",
      "Set org.pomologie.fragmented to 29 allocation-block chunks, each filled with successive byte values 1 through 29, followed by the literal ASCII string unaligned trailing bytes.",
      "Read exact values with getxattr, detach the image, and export with hdiutil convert -format UDTO."
    ]
  },
